{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>朝中社周二（10日）報道，當局周一（9日）在東部海域試射新型高速魚雷武器系統。報道說，這款武器系統的戰鬥效果得到驗證，將在2027年初列裝海軍。（朝中社/新華社）</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.248776+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":81,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T01:47:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:56.296526+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:04.310421+00:00","content_hash":"45e677fdd19b6c373dccca1d1b8fbc4e2b86d492ef66b68c4ac4e9e7db283032","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}